{"ticker":{"symbol":"006890.KS","name":"태경케미컬","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":4415.0,"change_pct":0.02674418604651163,"market_cap":51214000128.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.04077010192525481,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":11640.0,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Gas","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://www.taekyungchem.co.kr","business_summary":"Taekyung Chemical Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells liquid and solid carbon dioxide and dry ice in Korea. The company offers magnesium hydroxide, ethylene, liquid oxygen, liquid nitrogen, and argon. Its products are primarily used in industry, food and beverage, medicine, fresh food delivery, quick freezing, cooling, blast cleaning, food preservation, deflashing, cryogenic grinding, welding, desulfurization, and neutralization, as well as fog effect for event. The company was formerly known as Daeduk Industry Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Taekyung Chemical Co., Ltd. in 2000. Taekyung Chemical Co., Ltd. was founded in 1970 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"태경화학(주)는 한국에서 액체 및 고체 이산화탄소와 드라이아이스를 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 수산화마그네슘, 에틸렌, 액체 산소, 액체 질소 및 아르곤을 제공합니다. 해당 제품은 주로 산업, 식품 및 음료, 의약품, 신선 식품 배달, 급속 냉동, 냉각, 폭발 청소, 식품 보존, 디플래싱, 극저온 연삭, 용접, 탈황 및 중화 및 이벤트 안개 효과에 사용됩니다. 이 회사는 이전에 대덕산업주식회사로 알려져 있었고 2000년에 태경화학주식회사로 상호를 변경했습니다. 태경화학주식회사는 1970년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"가스","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":59613478490.0,"operating_income":10400585110.0,"net_income":8867607140.0,"eps":782.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":70748221180.0,"operating_income":17877382070.0,"net_income":17419399590.0,"eps":1537.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":71116461800.0,"operating_income":13705903990.0,"net_income":126157801